AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMRO_0000006> "A motor behavior that happens as a response to an emotion process. The motoric response includes muscle contractions that may move parts of the body or prevent the body from moving (e.g., freezing)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMRO_0000006> "motoric response to emotion (EMRO)"@en)
